            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners (HollyFrontier Cheyenne Refining LLC), petitioners (HollyFrontier Cheyenne Refining LLC) asked the Court to allow small refineries to obtain extensions of the Renewable Fuel Standard exemption based on hardship."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners (HollyFrontier Cheyenne Refining LLC)",
        "citations": [
