            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners (HollyFrontier Cheyenne Refining LLC), petitioners also argued that the word \u201cextension\u201d should be read temporally to mean an increase in the length of time of the exemption."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Renewable Fuel Producers",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "25993d3741ea8374b33fc51610eb4a232985c549b712c94819633532bf0160d4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-25993d3741ea-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Renewable Fuel Producers contended that the EPA acted beyond its statutory jurisdiction by granting such extensions."
      },
      {
